        "id": 1176763
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-14T15:28:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting. Why have you resisted this?\n\nAs I mentioned in the patch description, this is required for sg_write_buffer for FFU and RPMB testing. fyi; regardless of this in GKI, we have to enable it in Pixel.",
